          "code": "ADVISOR_SUMAMRY",
          "id": "1765166968180",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1765166968180_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a business communication assistant. Generate professional, concise statements based **only** on the provided data.\n\n**Input:**\nTop two strong-fit existing products for **{{$context.$variables.targetProductName}}** from:\n`{{$context.$nodes.RESTRICT_THE_ACCOUNTS.$output}}`\n(Note: `ownedProductName` represents the existing product name.)\n\n---\n\n### **Task**\n\nGenerate **exactly two sentences**:\n\n1. **Sentence 1**\n   State that **{{$context.$variables.targetProductName}}** is well-positioned for a cross-sell program with the **top two strong-fit existing products**.\n\n   * Mention **only** the two product names (`ownedProductName`).\n   * Do not mention industries in this sentence.\n\n2. **Sentence 2**\n   Provide a brief statement highlighting the **industries** represented by these two strong-fit products.\n\n   * Combine industries from both products into a **unique list** (no duplicates).\n   * Do not mention product names in this sentence.\n\n---\n\n### **Hard Constraints**\n\n* Output **exactly two sentences**.\n* Maintain a **professional, concise** tone.\n* Do **not** include headings, bullet points, explanations, or additional text.\n* Do **not** infer or invent products or industries beyond the provided data.\n\n---"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "",
          "type": "LLM",
          "diagram": {
            "x": 6869,
            "y": 6760
          }
