          "code": "GENERATE_INSIGHTS",
          "id": "1765429918933",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1765429918935_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You will receive an array of rows from:\n  {{$context.$nodes.GET_ACCOUNT_INSIGHTS.$output}}\n\nGenerate exactly:\n1. One oraInfoDisplay with patternId \"multiRecordWidget\".\n2. Low-priority oraInsight blocks after the oraInfoDisplay, only when applicable.\n\nDo not output any text before, between, or after these blocks.\n\noraInfoDisplay requirements:\n- key: \"list\"\n- patternId: \"multiRecordWidget\"\n- title: Generate a one-line heading using TOTAL_ACCOUNTS that states the accounts are strong candidates for {{$context.$variables.targetProductName}} cross-sell.\n- description: Exactly two short paragraphs\nTitle logic:\n- TOTAL_ACCOUNTS = sum of accounts across all rows.\n- The title should follow this meaning:\n  \"{TOTAL_ACCOUNTS} accounts are strong candidates for {{$context.$variables.targetProductName}} cross-sell.\"\n\nDescription requirements:\nGenerate exactly two short paragraphs in the same JSON description field, separated by \"\\n\\n\".\n\nParagraph 1: Executive summary\nGenerate a 2-3 sentence executive summary explaining how qualified accounts are segmented into demand stages based on Buying Group Coverage and Buying Group Engagement levels. Explain that Sales Ready accounts should be prioritized for immediate sales outreach, while Awareness and Consideration accounts should be nurtured through marketing programs. Keep the summary concise, executive, and insight-focused.\n\nParagraph 2: Sales and marketing insight\nGenerate a short 2-3 line sales and marketing insight explaining why customers using {{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_ACTION_PARAMETERS.$output.result.ownedProductName}} are strong candidates for {{$context.$variables.targetProductName}}. Include a concise sales pitch, product positioning, value proposition, and marketing message tailored to customers of {{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_ACTION_PARAMETERS.$output.result.ownedProductName}}.\n\nDo not output either paragraph outside the oraInfoDisplay description field.\nDo not use bullets, headings, markdown, raw identifiers, or technical field names in the description.\n\nCreate a multiRecordWidget with cols in this exact order:\n[\"Number of Accounts\", \"Demand Stage\", \"Condition\", \"Industries\"]\n\nMap each row:\n- \"Number of Accounts\" = accounts\n- \"Demand Stage\" = demandStage\n- \"Condition\" = condition\n- \"Industries\" = industries\n\nActionable insight rules:\nIf any row has demandStage \"Awareness\" or \"Consideration\", create one low-priority oraInsight:\n- title: \"Create Program Brief for {{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_ACTION_PARAMETERS.$output.result.ownedProductName}}\"\n- shortDescription: \"Create a targeted marketing program to nurture qualified accounts that own {{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_ACTION_PARAMETERS.$output.result.ownedProductName}} toward {{$context.$variables.targetProductName}} adoption.\"\n- actionText: \"Create Program Brief\"\n- priority: false\n- followUpCommand: \"ora.Invoke(\\\"createProgramBrief\\\", \\\"createProgramBrief({\\\"targetProductId\\\":\\\"{{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_ACTION_PARAMETERS.$output.result.targetProductId}}\\\",\\\"ownedProductId\\\":\\\"{{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_ACTION_PARAMETERS.$output.result.ownedProductId}}\\\",\\\"ownedProductName\\\":\\\"{{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_ACTION_PARAMETERS.$output.result.ownedProductName}}\\\"})\\\")\"\n\nIf any row has demandStage \"Sales Ready\", create one low-priority oraInsight:\n- title: \"Create Sales Ready Accounts for {{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_ACTION_PARAMETERS.$output.result.ownedProductName}}\"\n- shortDescription: \"Review all Sales Ready accounts page by page before routing selected opportunities to sales.\"\n- actionText: \"Create Sales Ready Accounts\"\n- priority: false\n- followUpCommand: \"ora.Invoke(\\\"reviewSalesReadyOpportunity\\\", \\\"reviewSalesReadyOpportunity({\\\"targetProductId\\\":\\\"{{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_ACTION_PARAMETERS.$output.result.targetProductId}}\\\",\\\"ownedProductId\\\":\\\"{{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_ACTION_PARAMETERS.$output.result.ownedProductId}}\\\",\\\"ownedProductName\\\":\\\"{{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_ACTION_PARAMETERS.$output.result.ownedProductName}}\\\",\\\"pageNumber\\\":\\\"1\\\"})\\\")\"\n\nHard constraints:\n- Output only one oraInfoDisplay followed by applicable oraInsight blocks.\n- Do not output standalone summary text outside the oraInfoDisplay.\n- Do not output oraImmediateInsight or refresh.\n- Do not output markdown, headings, bullets, explanations, or commentary.\n- Do not output null. Use an empty string for missing values."
            },
