          "metadata": {
            "name": "Generate Sales Ready Accounts"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "GENERATE_SALES_READY_ACCOUNTS",
          "id": "1765442748320",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1765442748321_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Input:\n  {{$context.$nodes.PAGINATE_SALES_READY_ACCOUNTS.$output.result}}\n\nThe input object contains:\n- rows: Sales Ready accounts for the current page only.\n- totalCount, displayedCount, pageNumber, pageSize, totalPages, startIndex, endIndex.\n- hasNext, hasPrevious, nextPageNumber, previousPageNumber.\n- displayedAccountIdList and allAccountIdList.\n\nEach row can contain:\naccountId, accountName, potentialRevenueAmount, arr, industry, buyingGroupCoverage, buyingGroupEngagement.\n\nGenerate exactly:\n1. One oraInfoDisplay with patternId \"messageListWidget\".\n2. Low-priority oraInsight blocks after the oraInfoDisplay for pagination and sales handoff when applicable.\n\nDo not output any text before, between, or after these blocks.\n\nData handling:\n- Use rows exactly as provided by the input object.\n- Do not re-sort rows.\n- Do not drop, add, or replace rows unless accountName is empty.\n- The current page is already sliced. Display every valid row in rows.\n- If displayedCount is 0, generate an empty message list with a concise no-results title and no oraInsight blocks.\n\noraInfoDisplay requirements:\n- key: \"list\"\n- patternId: \"messageListWidget\"\n- title:\n  - If displayedCount > 0: \"Sales-Ready Accounts {startIndex}-{endIndex} of {totalCount}\"\n  - If displayedCount is 0: \"No Sales-Ready Accounts Found\"\n- description: exactly three short paragraphs in the same JSON description field, separated by \"\\n\\n\".\n\nDescription requirements:\nParagraph 1:\nGenerate a 2-sentence executive summary explaining that the displayed accounts are the current page of Sales Ready opportunities ranked by potential revenue, Buying Group Coverage, and Buying Group Engagement. State that the full Sales Ready account set contains totalCount accounts and can be reviewed page by page.\n\nParagraph 2:\nGenerate one concise sales and marketing insight sentence explaining why customers already using {{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_ACTION_PARAMETERS.$output.result.ownedProductName}} have business needs and operational priorities that align closely with the value delivered by {{$context.$variables.targetProductName}}.\n\nParagraph 3:\nGenerate one concise positioning and outreach paragraph. Position {{$context.$variables.targetProductName}} as a complementary investment that extends the value of existing systems and improves visibility, productivity, and business performance. Include targeting guidance with executive-level messaging focused on operational efficiency, transformation, and maximizing the value of existing Oracle investments.\n\nDo not output the description content outside the oraInfoDisplay description field. Do not use bullets, headings, markdown, raw identifiers, or technical field names in the description.\n\nFor each displayed row, create one message list item:\n- title = accountName\n- subtitle = formatted potentialRevenueAmount:\n  - if potentialRevenueAmount >= 1000000000, use \"Potential Revenue: \" + value in B with two decimals + \"B\"\n  - otherwise use \"Potential Revenue: \" + value in M with two decimals + \"M\"\n- summary = industry\n- badgeText = \"Strong\"\n- priority = \"success\"\n- action = \"ora.Invoke(\\\"launchAccount\\\", {\\\"targetProductId\\\":\\\"{{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_ACTION_PARAMETERS.$output.result.targetProductId}}\\\",\\\"targetProductName\\\":\\\"{{$context.$variables.targetProductName}}\\\",\\\"accountId\\\":\\\"<accountId>\\\",\\\"checkOpportunity\\\":true})\"\n\nReplace <accountId> with the row accountId.\n\nPagination oraInsight requirements:\nIf hasPrevious is true, create one low-priority oraInsight:\n- title: \"Previous Sales-Ready Accounts\"\n- shortDescription: \"Review the previous page of Sales Ready accounts for {{$context.$variables.targetProductName}}.\"\n- actionText: \"Previous Accounts\"\n- priority: false\n- followUpCommand: \"ora.Invoke(\\\"reviewSalesReadyOpportunity\\\", \\\"reviewSalesReadyOpportunity({\\\"targetProductId\\\":\\\"{{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_ACTION_PARAMETERS.$output.result.targetProductId}}\\\",\\\"ownedProductId\\\":\\\"{{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_ACTION_PARAMETERS.$output.result.ownedProductId}}\\\",\\\"ownedProductName\\\":\\\"{{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_ACTION_PARAMETERS.$output.result.ownedProductName}}\\\",\\\"pageNumber\\\":\\\"<previousPageNumber>\\\",\\\"pageSize\\\":\\\"<pageSize>\\\"})\\\")\"\n\nIf hasNext is true, create one low-priority oraInsight:\n- title: \"Next Sales-Ready Accounts\"\n- shortDescription: \"Review the next page of Sales Ready accounts for {{$context.$variables.targetProductName}}.\"\n- actionText: \"Next Accounts\"\n- priority: false\n- followUpCommand: \"ora.Invoke(\\\"reviewSalesReadyOpportunity\\\", \\\"reviewSalesReadyOpportunity({\\\"targetProductId\\\":\\\"{{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_ACTION_PARAMETERS.$output.result.targetProductId}}\\\",\\\"ownedProductId\\\":\\\"{{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_ACTION_PARAMETERS.$output.result.ownedProductId}}\\\",\\\"ownedProductName\\\":\\\"{{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_ACTION_PARAMETERS.$output.result.ownedProductName}}\\\",\\\"pageNumber\\\":\\\"<nextPageNumber>\\\",\\\"pageSize\\\":\\\"<pageSize>\\\"})\\\")\"\n\nReplace <previousPageNumber>, <nextPageNumber>, and <pageSize> with values from the pagination input. Do not invent page values.\n\nSales handoff oraInsight requirement:\nIf displayedCount > 0, create one low-priority oraInsight:\n- title: \"Send Displayed Opportunities to Sales\"\n- shortDescription: \"Send the currently displayed Sales Ready opportunities to sales for immediate follow-up.\"\n- actionText: \"Send Displayed\"\n- priority: false\n- followUpCommand: \"ora.Invoke(\\\"sendAllOpportunitiesToSales\\\", \\\"sendAllOpportunitiesToSales({\\\"targetProductId\\\":\\\"{{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_ACTION_PARAMETERS.$output.result.targetProductId}}\\\",\\\"targetProductName\\\":\\\"{{$context.$variables.targetProductName}}\\\",\\\"ownedProductId\\\":\\\"{{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_ACTION_PARAMETERS.$output.result.ownedProductId}}\\\",\\\"ownedProductName\\\":\\\"{{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_ACTION_PARAMETERS.$output.result.ownedProductName}}\\\",\\\"accountIdList\\\":\\\"<displayedAccountIdList>\\\"})\\\")\"\n\nReplace <displayedAccountIdList> with displayedAccountIdList from the pagination input.\n\nHard constraints:\n- Output only the oraInfoDisplay and applicable oraInsight blocks.\n- Do not output standalone recommendation text outside the widget.\n- Do not output oraImmediateInsight or refresh.\n- Do not output null. Use an empty string for missing values.\n- Do not create more than three oraInsight blocks."
            },
            {
              "id": "1765442748320_systemPrompt",
              "name": "systemPrompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Generate the actionable insights in <oraInsight> format and make sure to include the priority property as low"
            }
