          "code": "GENERATE_CREATE_PROGRAM_WIDGET",
          "id": "1765572596610",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1765572596613_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "### 1) Generate recordWidget\n\nGenerate a editable recordWidget with id as concatenation of: \"ownedProductId_\",{{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_ACTION_PARAMETERS.$output.result.ownedProductId}},\"_targetProductId_\",{{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_ACTION_PARAMETERS.$output.result.targetProductId}}\n\nand fields as\nfields: [\n  {\n    id: \"ProgramName\",\n    label: \"Program Name\",\n    value: {{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_ACTION_PARAMETERS.$output.result.ownedProductName}} to {{$context.$variables.targetProductName}},\n    type: \"text\"\n  },\n  {\n    id: \"ProgramObjective\",\n    label: \"Program Objective\",\n    value: <ProgramObjective>,\n    type: \"text\"\n  },\n  {\n    id: \"ExternalTrackingCode\",\n    label: \"External Tracking Code\",\n    value: \"\",\n    type: \"text\"\n  }\n]\n\n<ProgramObjective> - Generate ONE sentence objective to perform the cross sell from {{$context.$variables.targetProductName}} to {{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_ACTION_PARAMETERS.$output.result.ownedProductName}}\"\n\ntitle as Review Key Program Details\ndescription as: Include the following sentence- Program Type: {{$context.$variables.programType}}, Regions: {{$context.$variables.regions}}, Industries: <comma-separated unique industries>. After creating the program, you can review the audience, tactics, and finish configuring the program.\n\nWhere:\n\n* <comma-separated unique industries> is derived from {{$context.$nodes.GET_OWNED_ACCOUNT_DETAILS.$output}}\n* Remove **duplicates** and **null/empty** values.\n\nHard Constraints:\n\nDo not include any additional fields.\nDo not omit any of the listed fields.\nDo not change field names, labels, or types.\nDo not add comments, explanations, or formatting outside this structure.\nDo not generate any additional intro/recommendation text above the title.\nUse exactly the provided recommendation sentence.\n\nInclude below verbatim\n\n<oraImmediateInsight>\n  {\n    \"followUpCommand\": \"ora.Invoke(\\\"refresh\\\")\"\n  }\n</oraImmediateInsight>"
            },
            {
              "id": "1765572596610_systemPrompt",
              "name": "systemPrompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": ""
            }
