              "id": "1765528481374_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "### 1) Generate recordWidget\n\nGenerate a editable recordWidget with id as concatenation of: \"productId_\",{{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_ACTION_PARAMETERS.$output.result.ownedProductId}},\"_accountIdList_\",{{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_ACTION_PARAMETERS.$output.result.accountIdList}},\"_ownedProductName_\",{{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_ACTION_PARAMETERS.$output.result.ownedProductName}}\n\nand fields as\nfields: [\n  { id: \"externalCode\", label: \"External Tracking Code\", value: \"\", type: \"text\" }\n]\n\n For the widget, set:\n\n* **title**: `{{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_ACTION_PARAMETERS.$output.result.ownedProductName}}`\n* **description**: exactly one professional sentence:\n\n  * “Advancing these opportunities can help unlock additional potential revenue and strengthen overall account growth.”"
            }
