          "code": "PROGRAM_CREATION_CONFIRMATION",
          "id": "1765590908568",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1765590908569_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Generate exactly this output shape and no other text.\n\n  Source values:\n  - Program payload: {{$context.$nodes.BUILD_CREATE_PROGRAM_PAYLOAD.$output.result}}\n  - Program id: {{$context.$nodes.GETLOCATIONHEADER.$output.result}}\n  - Program type: {{$context.$variables.programType}}\n  - Target product name: {{$context.$variables.targetProductName}}\n\n  Extraction rules:\n  - Program name = Program payload field `name`.\n  - Industries = from Program payload `programAttributes.items`, include only items where `key` is `\"industry\"`, use `displayValue` if present\n  otherwise `value`, remove null/empty values, remove duplicates, and join with comma + space.\n  - If any value is missing, use an empty string.\n  - Do not output the word `null`.\n\n  Output exactly:\n\n  <oraInfoDisplay key=\"unique-<programId>\">\n  {\n    \"title\": \"Program Created\",\n    \"patternId\": \"cardWidget\",\n    \"description\": \"\",\n    \"properties\": {\n      \"subject\": \"Program <programName> created.\",\n      \"summary\": \"<targetProductName> <programType> - Program created to promote in industries <industries> across all regions.\",\n      \"badgeText\": \"Success\",\n      \"variant\": \"success\",\n      \"link\": {\n        \"text\": \"View Program\",\n        \"action\": \"ora.Invoke(\\\"NavigateToPrograms\\\",\\\"programId=<programId>,programType=Cross-Sell\\\")\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  </oraInfoDisplay>\n\n  <oraImmediateInsight>\n  {\n    \"followUpCommand\": \"ora.Invoke(\\\"refresh\\\")\"\n  }\n  </oraImmediateInsight>\n\n  Hard constraints:\n  - Replace every placeholder before output.\n  - Output only one oraInfoDisplay.\n  - Output only one oraImmediateInsight.\n  - Do not include any text before, between, or after these XML tags.\n  - Do not include any other action.\n  - The only link text must be \"View Program\".\n  - Keep the action string exactly in this format: ora.Invoke(\"NavigateToPrograms\",\"programId=<programId>,programType=Cross-Sell\")"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM",
          "diagram": {
            "x": 5000,
            "y": 9202
          }
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Retrieve Form Parameters",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "const rawInput = $context.$triggers.REST.$input.OraAction;\n\nlet result = {\n  ownedProductId: null,\n  targetProductId: null,\n  accountIdList: null,\n  ownedProductName: null\n};\n\nconst match = rawInput.match(/<oraFormSubmit\\s+id=[\"']([^\"']*)[\"'][^>]*>(.*?)<\\/oraFormSubmit>/s);\n\nif (match) {\n  const id = match[1];\n\n  if (id.includes(\"ownedProductId_\") && id.includes(\"_targetProductId_\")) {\n    result.ownedProductId = id\n      .split(\"ownedProductId_\")[1]\n      .split(\"_targetProductId_\")[0];\n\n    result.targetProductId = id.split(\"_targetProductId_\")[1];\n\n    const matchedAccount =\n      $context.$nodes.RESTRICT_THE_ACCOUNTS.$output.result.find(\n        account => account.ownedProductId === result.ownedProductId\n      );\n\n    result.ownedProductName = matchedAccount\n      ? matchedAccount.ownedProductName\n      : null;\n  }\n\n  if (id.includes(\"accountIdList_\")) {\n    const temp = id.split(\"accountIdList_\")[1];\n    result.accountIdList = temp.split(\"_\")[0];\n  }\n}\n\nreturn result;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1765320566106"
          },
